WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.098
A proportion states that two ratios are equal. Keep the unit rate constant when

00:00:05.098 --> 00:00:05.448
scaling.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:12.427
If 2 books cost Ghana cedis 10, how much do 4 books cost? The answer is 20. Multiply

00:00:12.427 --> 00:00:14.817
by 2: 10 times 2 equals 20.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:21.809
7 exercise books cost Ghana cedis 42. At the same unit price in a recycling club, how

00:00:21.809 --> 00:00:25.451
much do 42 books cost? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:33.230
7 exercise books cost Ghana cedis 42. At the same unit price in a recycling club, how

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:40.993
much do 42 books cost? The answer is 252. The cost of one is Ghana cedis 6; 42 cost

00:00:40.993 --> 00:00:42.219
Ghana cedis 252.
